 navigator, Iven Marr, knows she has it."}]},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolcall","id":{"provider":"call_OdwJHyFORmJAIRNSyQIACwWW"},"function":{"name":"search_world","arguments":{"query":"Asha Pell Captain Ash, her navigator Iven Marr, and the old lens room beneath Vesper's lighthouse"}},"native":{"item":{"id":"call_OdwJHyFORmJAIRNSyQIACwWW","type":"function","function":{"name":"search_world","arguments":"{\"query\":\"Asha Pell Captain Ash, her navigator Iven Marr, and the old lens room beneath Vesper's lighthouse\"}"}},"fingerprint":"1620d932af3566c7"}}],"origin":{"api":"openai.chat","provider":"openrouter","model":"openai/gpt-6-luna","response_model":"openai/gpt-6-luna","response_id":"gen-1793273322-62tOjEBW6wvUQkNfvHND"},"stop":"tool_use"},{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"toolresult","call":{"provider":"call_OdwJHyFORmJAIRNSyQIACwWW"},"name":"search_world","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Asha Pell (person) [ID: 5affd0ca-9c42-4463-bed7-ad12e3c38d62] [Aliases: Captain Ash]: Asha Pell captains the courier ship Nightjar, grew up in Vesper, and belongs to the Lantern Guild. Her crew usually calls her Captain Ash.\n  Properties: source_conversation: 01a18769-1953-7785-bf1a-1d436775cbaf\n  - ← UNRELATED_TO from Bren Vale (person) [ID: 3866be6c-f8eb-4158-8abb-a95e3ddc64b2] [Aliases: Captain]: Bren Vale captains the fishing boat Petrel. People on the dock also call him Captain. He is unrelated to Asha Pell and is not a member of the Lantern Guild.\n  - CAPTAINS → Nightjar (ship, courier ship) [ID: 36eac936-9ce0-4b27-9bf4-f77ae290dfa1]: A courier ship captained by Asha Pell.\n  - GREW_UP_IN → Vesper (city, port city) [ID: ccb13663-df18-4e63-b89c-006464a6cfb2]: Brinewake's main port city, built around a tidal lighthouse.\n  - MEMBER_OF → Lantern Guild (guild) [ID: a4140448-57b9-47e2-9fad-b44a4a957bdd]: Maintains Vesper's tidal lighthouse and buys blue salt from Orin's miners. It does not own the mines.\n\nNightjar (ship, courier ship) [ID: 36eac936-9ce0-4b2